# 15 tasks, 10 threads — forces scheduler to choose
# HIGH (6 tasks) should fill threads first
# MEDIUM and LOW wait for free threads

task 1 HighCalc1 io high
task 2 HighCalc2 io high
task 3 HighCalc3 io high
task 4 HighCalc4 io high
task 5 HighFetch1 io high
task 6 HighFetch2 io high
task 7 MedCalc1 io medium
task 8 MedCalc2 io medium
task 9 MedFetch1 io medium
task 10 MedFetch2 io medium
task 11 LowCalc1 io low
task 12 LowCalc2 io low
task 13 LowCalc3 io low
task 14 LowFetch1 io low
task 15 LowFetch2 io low